        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The castle walls are your only sanctuary, and they will not hold forever. You are the last <strong>Crusader,</strong> the final bastion against a tide of goblins, ghosts, ghouls, and grotesque abominations bent on extinguishing the last light of the kingdom—<strong>Princess Plum.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crusader</strong> is a high-octane, <strong>survival-based FPS</strong> that blends <strong>arcade action</strong> with deep <strong>roguelike</strong> progression. The gameplay is simple, but the challenge is endless. Every kill earns you coin, and every coin is a choice. Do you risk it all on a powerful new weapon, or gamble on a <strong>mystery mushroom</strong> upgrade that could turn the tide of battle? With each wave, the enemy grows stronger, faster, and more numerous. But so do you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master satisfying movement, find the perfect vantage point on the castle ramparts, and unleash a hail of steel and spells upon the monstrous legion below. Collect rare gems to unlock <strong>permanent upgrades</strong>, ensuring every run makes you a more formidable protector. <strong>Rally an alliance of Paladin Tanks, Elven Healers, and Lightning Wizards </strong>to join your cause.<strong> </strong>This is not just a battle for survival; it is a quest for glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The princess is counting on you. Do not fail her, brave knight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless Wave-Based Combat:</strong> Stand your ground against an ever-escalating army of <strong>over a dozen unique enemy types</strong>—from swarming <strong>Goblins</strong> and wall-leaping <strong>Werewolves</strong> to teleporting <strong>Vampires</strong>, moving <strong>Castles</strong>, undead <strong>Zombies</strong>, alurring <strong>Demons</strong>, colossal <strong>Twin-Headed Ogres</strong>, flying <strong>Eyeballs</strong>, sprinting <strong>Goblin Queens</strong>, and screen-shaking <strong>Dragons!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Vast &amp; Unholy Arsenal:</strong> Unleash destruction with a diverse armory of weapons and spells. <strong>Snipe</strong> from the ramparts, release the <strong>Holy Hand Grenade</strong>, blast hordes with a powerful <strong>Shotgun</strong>, squash foes with a <strong>Boulder</strong>, toss a <strong>Boomerang</strong>, blow up a bouncing <strong>Shock Orb</strong>, shatter a <strong>Frostbolt</strong>, or guide a devastating <strong>Fireball</strong> to its target!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Roguelike Progression:</strong> No two runs are the same! Spend <strong>coins</strong> on new weapons, gamble at the <strong>Mystery Mushroom</strong>, or pray for a game-altering <strong>Magic Mushroom</strong> drop, granting you one of many temporary <strong>Super Power-ups.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit Your Own Army:</strong> You are not alone! Command the battlefield by <strong>summoning</strong> a trio of powerful AI allies: the unshakeable <strong>Paladin Tank</strong>, the devastating <strong>Lightning Wizard</strong>, and the life-saving <strong>Elven Healer.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Prestige System:</strong> Collect rare <strong>gems</strong> from fallen foes to unlock a huge pool of permanent, compounding upgrades. Reduce your <strong>spell cooldowns,</strong> increase your <strong>weapon capabilities,</strong> and gain more <strong>movement tricks</strong> that carry over between every crusade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>God-like Movement &amp; Agility:</strong> Master your fortress with <strong>catapult</strong> jump pads, satisfying <strong>wall-running</strong>, a powerful <strong>damage-dealing dash</strong>, trick <strong>sliding</strong>, and a springy <strong>grapple hook</strong>. The castle is your playground, not your prison.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Battlefield Control:</strong> Turn the tide with <strong>throwable turrets,</strong> smart <strong>translocators</strong>, and <strong>explosive barrels</strong>. Use the environment to your advantage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Personal Bard:</strong> Choose your battle anthem! <strong>Toss a coin</strong> to your loyal <strong>bard</strong> and select from over <strong>15 Hours</strong> of beautiful, atmospheric music. The soundtrack is yours to command.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Proverbs &amp; Full Fantasy Flavor:</strong> The world is packed with hidden <strong>Easter Eggs</strong>, a treacherous <strong>Mimic,</strong> and wisdom for your journey. With <strong>over 800 unique voicelines</strong>, every moment of peace is a chance for reflection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability:</strong> A scaling wave system, randomized upgrades, a deep prestige system, and unpredictable <strong>Wave Modifiers</strong> ensure the crusade never truly ends. How long can YOU survive?</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The castle walls are your only sanctuary, and they will not hold forever. You are the last <strong>Crusader,</strong> the final bastion against a tide of goblins, ghosts, ghouls, and grotesque abominations bent on extinguishing the last light of the kingdom—<strong>Princess Plum.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crusader</strong> is a high-octane, <strong>survival-based FPS</strong> that blends <strong>arcade action</strong> with deep <strong>roguelike</strong> progression. The gameplay is simple, but the challenge is endless. Every kill earns you coin, and every coin is a choice. Do you risk it all on a powerful new weapon, or gamble on a <strong>mystery mushroom</strong> upgrade that could turn the tide of battle? With each wave, the enemy grows stronger, faster, and more numerous. But so do you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master satisfying movement, find the perfect vantage point on the castle ramparts, and unleash a hail of steel and spells upon the monstrous legion below. Collect rare gems to unlock <strong>permanent upgrades</strong>, ensuring every run makes you a more formidable protector. <strong>Rally an alliance of Paladin Tanks, Elven Healers, and Lightning Wizards </strong>to join your cause.<strong> </strong>This is not just a battle for survival; it is a quest for glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The princess is counting on you. Do not fail her, brave knight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless Wave-Based Combat:</strong> Stand your ground against an ever-escalating army of <strong>over a dozen unique enemy types</strong>—from swarming <strong>Goblins</strong> and wall-leaping <strong>Werewolves</strong> to teleporting <strong>Vampires</strong>, moving <strong>Castles</strong>, undead <strong>Zombies</strong>, alurring <strong>Demons</strong>, colossal <strong>Twin-Headed Ogres</strong