hook</strong>. The castle is your playground, not your prison.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Battlefield Control:</strong> Turn the tide with <strong>throwable turrets,</strong> smart <strong>translocators</strong>, and <strong>explosive barrels</strong>. Use the environment to your advantage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Personal Bard:</strong> Choose your battle anthem! <strong>Toss a coin</strong> to your loyal <strong>bard</strong> and select from over <strong>15 Hours</strong> of beautiful, atmospheric music. The soundtrack is yours to command.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful Proverbs &amp; Full Fantasy Flavor:</strong> The world is packed with hidden <strong>Easter Eggs</strong>, a treacherous <strong>Mimic,</strong> and wisdom for your journey. With <strong>over 800 unique voicelines</strong>, every moment of peace is a chance for reflection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability:</strong> A scaling wave system, randomized upgrades, a deep prestige system, and unpredictable <strong>Wave Modifiers</strong> ensure the crusade never truly ends. How long can YOU survive?</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Taste steel, monster scum! Crusader is a relentless FPS roguelike, defend your princess from invading waves of unholy horrors. Slay with a vast arsenal of weapons and spells. Earn coin and gems to upgrade your powers with magic mystery mushrooms and rally friendly AI forces to fight by your side! ⚔️",
